    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e88a4dbf30539b08",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 4 有哪些新变化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59f51f9654dd224e",
      "translationZh": "与 Gemma-3n 类似，Gemma 4 支持图像、文本和音频输入，并生成文本响应。文本解码器基于 Gemma 模型，支持长上下文窗口。图像编码器与 Gemma 3 的图像编码器类似，但有两项关键改进：支持可变宽高比，以及可配置的图像 token 输入数量，让你在速度、内存和质量之间找到最佳平衡点。所有模型都支持图像（或视频）和文本输入，而小型变体（E2B、E4B）及 12B Unified 模型还支持音频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfa34df771aab711",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 4 提供五种规模，每种都有基础版本和指令微调版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa74b9df52d28ae9",
      "translationZh": "参数规模",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cb25e88bb2f00fa",
      "translationZh": "上下文窗口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d76c241e62e34c37",
      "translationZh": "检查点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
